>
>       I got a bunch of pets:
>
> *  Will these guys go up in levels as they kill monsters?  Are they
> using the same sort of experience system as my character?

The system is a simpler one than your character, but they do
level put and they do gain hit points.

> *  Two of these guys have humanoid hands and bodies.  Are they using
> armor or weapons?  How do I get them better equipped?

Hand them better weapons or armor.  If they can use what you
hand them and it is better than what they have, they will switch
to it.  Until they wear/wield somethin cursed but pets avoid
picking up cursed stuff.  What they mean by "better" assumes
it's uncursed +0 so it becomes interesting to see what's better
and what isn't.  Note that they will swap any artifact for their
current weapon - even if that other weapon was already an
artifact.



